msgstr "Isku day inaad dib u rakibto cv2"

#: src/onboarding.py:341
msgid "No webcams found on system"
msgstr "Kaamarooyinka mareegaha lagama helin nidaamka"

#: src/onboarding.py:341
msgid ""
"Please configure your camera yourself if you are sure a compatible camera is "
"connected"
msgstr ""
"Fadlan isku habbee kamaradaada haddii aad hubto in kamarad ku habbooni ay ku "
"xidhan tahay"

#: src/onboarding.py:433
msgid "No, camera can't be opened"
msgstr "Maya, kamarad lama furi karo"

#: src/onboarding.py:445
msgid "No, not an infrared camera"
msgstr "Maya, maaha kamarad infrared ah"

#: src/onboarding.py:449
msgid "Yes, compatible infrared camera"
msgstr "Haa, kamarad infrared ah oo ku habboon"

#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid "Camera identifier or path"
msgstr "Aqoonsiga kamarada ama dariiqa"

#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "lagu taliyay"

#: src/onboarding.py:546 src/onboarding.py:585
msgid "Error selecting camera"
msgstr "Khalad doorashada kamarada"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "The selected camera cannot be opened"
msgstr "Kamarada la doortay lama furi karo"

#: src/onboarding.py:560
msgid "Try to select another one"
msgstr "Isku day inaad doorato mid kale"

#: src/onboarding.py:575
msgid ""
"Please visit\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"to enable your ir emitter"
msgstr ""
"Fadlan booqo\n"
"<a href=\"https://github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter\">https://"
"github.com/EmixamPP/linux-enable-ir-emitter</a>\n"
"si aad awood ugu yeelatid ir emitter-kaaga"

#: src/onboarding.py:643
msgid "Setup lighting 1"
msgstr "Dejinta nalka 1"

#: src/onboarding.py:644
msgid "Setup lighting 2"
msgstr "Habaynta nalka 2"

#: src/onboarding.py:662
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Ma badbaadin karo qaabka wajiga"

#: src/onboarding.py:667 src/onboarding.py:714
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Sawir model labaad"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Waa la duubi waayay qaabka labaad"

#: src/onboarding.py:674
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. The room must still "
"be bright enough to see your face — change the light rather than turning it "
"off — then try again, or skip and add a model later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Moodeelkaagii ugu horreeyay waa la keydiyay, marka waji galitaanka ayaa "
"horay u shaqeynayay. Qolku waa inuu weli iftiimayaa si uu u arko wejigaaga - "
"beddel iftiinka intii aad damin lahayd - ka dib isku day mar kale, ama ka "
"bood oo ku dar moodal hadhow Settings."

#: src/onboarding.py:708
msgid "Second scan: different lighting"
msgstr "Sawirka labaad: iftiin kala duwan"

#: src/onboarding.py:710
msgid ""
"First model saved. Now change the light — for example turn a lamp on or off, "
"move away from the window, or use the other room light — keep your face "
"clearly visible, then press Scan again."
msgstr ""
"Qaabkii ugu horeeyay waa la badbaadiyay. Hadda beddel iftiinka - tusaale "
"ahaan laambadda shid ama dami, ka fogow daaqadda, ama isticmaal iftiinka "
"qolka kale - wejigaaga si cad u dhig, ka dibna mar kale riix Scan."

#: src/onboarding.py:752
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware and tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya "
"aqoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Habka TPM:</b> Hubinta qalabka TPM iyo agabka..."

#: src/onboarding.py:772
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya "
"aqoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Habka TPM:</b> Qalabka TPM waa la helay. Ku rakibida <i>tpm2-tools</i> si "
"toos ah..."

#: src/onboarding.py:784
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya "
"aqoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Habka TPM:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 firfircoon. Furahaaga sirta ah ayaa si "
"ammaan ah loogu xiri doonaa gudaha TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:786
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya "
"aqoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Habka TPM:</b> Qalabka TPM waa la helay, laakiin si toos ah u rakibida "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> wuu fashilmay. Ku orod <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</"
"code>. Ku soo noqoshada kaydinta aqoonsiga ku salaysan software."

#: src/onboarding.py:788
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello waxay si toos ah u furi kartaa {} adiga oo isticmaalaya "
"aqoonsiga wajiga (boorsada la ogaaday: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>Habka TPM:</b> Ma jiro qalab TPM ah oo la ogaaday. Isticmaalka kaydinta "
"aqoonsiga ku salaysan software (AES-256-GCM)."

