msgstr ""
"Sawirada wajigaaga oo Ubuntu Hello la barbar dhigo. Hayso ugu yaraan laba, "
"ku duub nal kala duwan."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Tusaya moodooyinka la kaydiyay ee:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Kaliya hal nooc oo weji ah ayaa diiwaan gashan. Iftiinku wuxuu beddelaa sida "
"wejigaagu u ekaado, sidaas awgeed hal nooc ayaa ku fashilmi kara fiidkii "
"hoostiisa (ama iftiinka maalinta). Ku dar qaab labaad oo lagu duubay iftiin "
"kala duwan si aad u sii furto la isku halayn karo wakhti kasta oo maalinta "
"ah."

#: src/main.ui:144
