"Ogeysiinta desktop-ka waxay muujineysaa marka Ubuntu Hello ay raadineyso "
"wejigaaga, ka dibna ka warbixiso natiijada. Isku day guuldarraystay ayaa ku "
"jiraya liiska wargelinta"

#: src/main.ui:466
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Muuji ogeysiisyada"

#: src/main.ui:472
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
